#: ../customize/handler.rst:3
msgid "Server Handler"
msgstr "服务端处理器"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:5
msgid ""
"Server handler is the object which parses server output and provides "
"command interfaces to control the server"
msgstr "服务端处理器是分析服务器输出并提供命令接口来控制服务器的对象"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:7
msgid ""
"MCDR itself already includes a number of server handlers for widely-used "
"Minecraft related servers, see the :ref:`configuration:handler` option. "
"But in case you have a server with custom output format, you can "
"customize your own server handler, and assign MCDR to use it"
msgstr ""
"MCDR 本身已经包含许多广泛使用的 Minecraft 服务端的处理器，见 :ref:`configuration:handler` "
"选项。但如果你的服务端有着自定义的输出格式，你可以自定义你自己的服务端处理器，并让 MCDR 使用它"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:10
msgid "There are 2 ways to customize a server handler:"
msgstr "自定义服务端处理器有 2 种方式："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:12
msgid ""
":ref:`customize/handler:Customize with Handler Spec`: Describe the "
"handler in YAML, mostly with regular expressions, no programming "
"required. It covers most of the cases, e.g. a different output format, a "
"different player name rule, or a prefix in player chat messages"
msgstr ""
":ref:`customize/handler:Customize with Handler Spec`：用 YAML "
"描述处理器，主要使用正则表达式，无需编程。它能覆盖大多数情况，例如不同的输出格式、不同的玩家名规则，或是玩家聊天消息中的前缀"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`customize/handler:Customize with Python`: Write a server handler "
"class in Python, for the cases that cannot be described by a handler spec"
msgstr ""
":ref:`customize/handler:Customize with Python`：用 Python "
"编写服务端处理器类，用于处理器定义表达不了的情况"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:17
msgid "Customize with Handler Spec"
msgstr "编写处理器定义"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:21
msgid ""
"A handler spec describes how MCDR controls the server, and how MCDR "
"parses the server output. All built-in handlers, except "
"``basic_handler``, are defined by handler specs. See "
":ref:`customize/handler:Built-in Handler Specs` for their contents"
msgstr ""
"处理器定义描述了 MCDR 如何控制服务端、如何解析服务端输出。除 ``basic_handler`` "
"外，所有内置处理器都是用处理器定义写成的，具体内容见 :ref:`customize/handler:Built-in Handler "
"Specs`"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:24
msgid ""
"You can define handlers with handler specs in the "
":ref:`configuration:custom_handlers` option of the MCDR configuration. "
"See :class:`~mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec` for the full "
"reference of the fields in a handler spec"
msgstr ""
"处理器定义写在 MCDR 配置的 :ref:`configuration:custom_handlers` 选项中。各字段的完整说明见 "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec`"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:28
msgid "Handler Spec Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:30
msgid ""
"In this example, we have a vanilla server, but some of the players have a"
" prefix on their username, which result in some changes to the message "
"format of the player chat message. For Example, A player with id "
"``Steve`` and prefix ``[Builder]`` might have following chat messages:"
msgstr ""
"假设我们有一个原版服务器，但某些玩家的用户名加有前缀，这将导致玩家聊天消息的消息格式发生一些更改。例如，具有 ID ``Steve`` 和前缀 "
"``[Builder]`` 的玩家可能有以下聊天消息："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:38
msgid ""
"For the default vanilla handler, ``[Builder]Steve`` is an illegal player "
"name. Luckily all possible prefixes of the players in the server follows "
"the same format ``[Prefix]PlayerName``. So we can extend the built-in "
"``vanilla_handler``, and add a player message rule for it in the MCDR "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""
"对于默认的原版服务端处理器，``[Builder]Steve`` 是一个非法的玩家名称。幸运的是，服务器中所有可能的玩家前缀都遵循相同的格式，即 "
"``[前缀]玩家名称``。因此，我们可以在 MCDR 配置中继承内置的 ``vanilla_handler``，并为其添加一条玩家消息规则："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:56
msgid ""
"``name``: The name of the new handler. It cannot be the same as any "
"existing handler. Set the :ref:`configuration:handler` option to it to "
"use the handler"
msgstr ""
"``name``：新处理器的名称，不能与任何已有的处理器重名。将 :ref:`configuration:handler` "
"选项设置为该名称，即可使用该处理器"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:58
msgid "``extends``: The built-in handler to extend"
msgstr "``extends``：要继承的内置处理器"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:59
msgid ""
"``overrides``: The parts of the handler spec to change. Everything not "
"mentioned is inherited from the built-in handler"
msgstr "``overrides``：要修改的部分，没写到的内容沿用内置处理器"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:61
msgid "Some notes on the ``player_message`` rules:"
msgstr "关于这里的 ``player_message`` 规则，有几点说明："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:63
msgid ""
"Lists are replaced as a whole, so the original rule of "
"``vanilla_handler`` needs to be copied along with the new rule. See "
":meth:`HandlerSpec.extend() "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend>` for the merging "
"rules"
msgstr ""
"列表会被整体替换，因此需要把 ``vanilla_handler`` 的原有规则连同新规则一起写上。合并规则见 "
":meth:`HandlerSpec.extend() "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend>`"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:65
msgid ""
"For ``<[Builder]Steve> Hello``, the first rule matches with player name "
"``[Builder]Steve``, which is not a valid player name, so the rule is "
"skipped, and the second rule matches with player name ``Steve``"
msgstr ""
"对于 ``<[Builder]Steve> Hello``，第一条规则匹配到的玩家名为 "
"``[Builder]Steve``，这不是一个合法的玩家名，因此该规则被跳过，随后第二条规则匹配到玩家名 ``Steve``"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:68
msgid ""
"Then use command ``!!MCDR reload config`` to apply the changes, and test "
"if it works as expected"
msgstr "然后使用命令 ``!!MCDR reload config`` 应用修改，并测试其是否按预期工作"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:71
msgid "Define a Handler from Scratch"
msgstr "从零定义处理器"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:73
msgid ""
"If the server is quite different from all built-in handlers, you can "
"provide a complete handler spec with the ``spec`` key, instead of "
"extending a built-in handler. For example, a non-Minecraft server that is"
" stopped by the ``SIGINT`` signal:"
msgstr ""
"如果服务端和所有内置处理器都差得比较远，可以不继承内置处理器，而是用 ``spec`` 键写一份完整的处理器定义。例如，一个用 "
"``SIGINT`` 信号关闭的非 Minecraft 服务端："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:96
msgid "Load from a File"
msgstr "从文件加载"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:98
msgid ""
"A handler spec entry can also be placed in a separate YAML file, and "
"referenced with the ``file`` key:"
msgstr "处理器定义也可以单独放在一个 YAML 文件里，再用 ``file`` 键引用："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:105
msgid "The content of the file is an ``extends`` or ``spec`` entry, e.g.:"
msgstr "文件内容即一项 ``extends`` 或 ``spec`` 写法的内容，例如："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:115
msgid ""
"The file path is relative to the working directory of MCDR, i.e. where "
"the ``config.yml`` is located. The file is read when the MCDR "
"configuration is loaded, so use ``!!MCDR reload config`` to apply the "
"changes in the file"
msgstr ""
"文件路径相对于 MCDR 的工作目录，即 ``config.yml`` 所在的目录。该文件在加载 MCDR 配置时被读取，因此修改文件后，请使用 "
"``!!MCDR reload config`` 来应用修改"

