#: ../customize/handler.rst:174
msgid "Customize with Python"
msgstr "编写 Python 代码"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:176
msgid ""
"If a handler spec is not enough, e.g. the parsing needs some program "
"logic, you can write a server handler class in Python"
msgstr "如果处理器定义满足不了需求，比如解析时需要一些程序逻辑，可以用 Python 编写服务端处理器类"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:178
msgid ""
"To design a server handler, you need to inherit from an existed server "
"handler class, or the base class "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.server_handler.ServerHandler`. Common "
"choices are:"
msgstr ""
"要设计服务端处理器，你需要从现有的服务端处理器类或 "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.server_handler.ServerHandler` 基类继承。常见的选择有："

#: ../customize/handler.rst:181
msgid ""
"A built-in handler class, e.g. "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.impl.VanillaHandler`, and override some of "
"its methods to add extra logic"
msgstr ""
"内置处理器类，例如 "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.impl.VanillaHandler`，并重写其部分方法以添加额外逻辑"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:182
msgid ""
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.impl.SpecServerHandler`, with your own "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec`"
msgstr ""
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.impl.SpecServerHandler`，搭配你自己的 "
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec`"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:183
msgid ""
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.server_handler.ServerHandler`, and implement"
" everything by yourself. To stop the server, implement "
":meth:`~mcdreforged.handler.server_handler.ServerHandler.get_stop_method`"
msgstr ""
":class:`~mcdreforged.handler.server_handler.ServerHandler`，并自行实现所有内容。关闭服务端需实现"
" "
":meth:`~mcdreforged.handler.server_handler.ServerHandler.get_stop_method`"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:186
msgid ""
"For easier usage, management and possible distribution in the future, it "
"is recommended to provide server handlers by creating a "
":ref:`plugin_dev/basic:MCDR Plugin` and using the "
":meth:`~mcdreforged.plugin.si.plugin_server_interface.PluginServerInterface.register_server_handler`"
" API"
msgstr ""
"为了更方便的使用、管理以及后续可能的分发，建议创建一个 :ref:`plugin_dev/basic:MCDR Plugin`，并使用 "
":meth:`~mcdreforged.plugin.si.plugin_server_interface.PluginServerInterface.register_server_handler`"
" API，来提供服务端处理器"

