"(Optional) Reload the plugin with command ``!!MCDR plugin reload "
"handler_for_my_server``"
msgstr "（可选）使用命令 ``!!MCDR plugin reload handler_for_my_server`` 重新加载插件"

#: ../customize/handler.rst:270
msgid ""
"As a alternative but **not recommended** way, you may provide your "
"handler by a single ``.py`` file, rather than a plugin"
msgstr "除此之外，还有一种 **不推荐** 的方式，你可以通过一个 ``.py`` 文件来提供服务端处理器"

